sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GEN as Q-Gen (AI)
  participant UI as UI
  participant LRN as Learner
  participant ADP as Adaptivity (Coach+LM)
  participant SCR as Web Scraper
  participant FT as Fine-tuning

  SCR->>FT: Subject corpus (web + syllabus)
  FT-->>GEN: Fine-tuned transformer (domain)
  Note over SCR,GEN: Offline prep (periodic): scrape → fine-tune → deploy

  ADP->>GEN: Generate question (subject + strategy)
  GEN-->>UI: Question
  UI-->>LRN: Show question
  LRN-->>UI: Answer
  UI->>ADP: Log response (correctness, time, confidence)
  Note over UI,ADP: + optional affect\n  - self-report (valence/arousal)\n  - text-inferred (frustration, demotivation)
  ADP->>ADP: Update model + strategy

  loop Next item
    ADP->>GEN: Generate next question
    GEN-->>UI: Question
    UI-->>LRN: Show
    LRN-->>UI: Answer
  UI->>ADP: Log response (+ affect if available)
  Note over UI,ADP: affect included if captured\n    (self-report or text model)
    ADP->>ADP: Update
  end
